HexECPP was independently reviewed against HexECPP/SPEC/hex-ecpp.md by a
skeptical Opus reviewer, separately from the implementation PR reviews.
The initial and follow-up reviews are retained in
reports/ecpp/audit/phase2-review.txt and phase2-followup.txt; their verified
findings and dispositions are recorded in reports/hex-ecpp-audit.md.

The review covers raw constructors, canonical residues and checked inverse
replay, strict size boundaries, subject binding, parser/converter allocation
and location policies, class-number-one CM proposals and exceptional twists,
shared accounting through backtracking, diagnostic priority, terminal size
traversal and stateful memo reuse. Repeated complete-child checking and the
recursive diagnostic overwrite are fixed. No computational prerequisite,
wrong-shape scaffold, data placeholder or required core proof gap remains.

Curve semantics, Hasse and unconditional primality belong to the separately
owned HexECPPTheory SPEC and issue 10586. This attestation covers Phase 2;
it does not certify performance, subsequent phases or publication.
